{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415764","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415764","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041576401:1":{"text":"お、お前の羽……","source_cn":"你、你的羽毛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD75C971ED5FF5984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576402:1":{"text":"私の羽がどうかしたの？","source_cn":"我的羽毛怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED891EAE07B0B82F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576403:1":{"text":"赤い……まるで……火に焼かれたようだ。","source_cn":"好红……像是……被火烧过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2219B699A3A3A9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576404:1":{"text":"ええ、実際これは羽が燃え尽きたあと、再び炎の中から生まれたものなの。","source_cn":"它们的确是旧羽焚尽后，浴火而生的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55D32B7068451315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576405:1":{"text":"なぜ火を……？元の羽が嫌いだったのか？","source_cn":"为什么要用火……？你讨厌原本的它们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC31C1F7F2127A42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576406:1":{"text":"いいえ。私は自分の羽をとても大切に思っているわ。","source_cn":"不，我很珍爱我的羽毛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4474D66ABAFD647A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576407:1":{"text":"どうしてかと言うのなら……鷹も隼も羽が生え替わるでしょう。古い羽が去ってこそ、新しい羽が生まれるの。","source_cn":"至于为什么，正如鹰隼也要经历换羽一般，旧的羽毛逝去，新...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC2AE882ADFF6525","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576408:1":{"text":"もし、古い羽を、すべてむしって……新しい羽が、生えてこなかったら？","source_cn":"要是，旧的羽毛，拔光，新的羽毛，不长出来呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15AD49AB93C48CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576409:1":{"text":"それは……何かの病という意味かしら？","source_cn":"你说的……是一种疾病？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x225AAFDFDB6E7301","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576410:1":{"text":"病ではない……あの方が、そう選んだのだ。","source_cn":"不是病，是他做出的，选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x578DC1FFF87AC630","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576411:1":{"text":"つまり……その人は、自分の意志でそうしたのね？","source_cn":"也就是说……这是你口中之人自己的意志？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07AB5CDF4B13FBFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576412:1":{"text":".……分かりました。","source_cn":"……是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E0328B18230A536","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576413:1":{"text":"だがその理由が、分からない。","source_cn":"但，为什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56EA70126C683D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041576414:1":{"text":"もしも……空を翔けることが私たちの運命で、空が私たちの楽園なのだとしても……","source_cn":"如果说，翱翔于天是我们的命运，天空是我们的乐园……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DDED4875F7E421D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041576415:1":{"text":"運命に押し流されることをよしとせず、未知へ導かれることを受け入れられない人もいるわ。","source_cn":"也会有人不甘于让命运推着走，不甘于让命运带自己到未知里去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x388B27EADDF99A64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041576416:1":{"text":"最初は誰だって、自分なら運命に逆らえると思うものよ。","source_cn":"一开始的时候，人都会觉得自己能违抗命运。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F0283F66DC4B510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041576417:1":{"text":"結果的に、本当に逆らえた者もいれば、そうでない者もいる。","source_cn":"到最后，或许真的可以，又或许不然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9019BBD6C2DF86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041576418:1":{"text":"あなたは自分で何かを選んだことはある？その選択を後悔したことは？","source_cn":"你有做出过你的选择吗？你会为之后悔吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B2396BA4FD5B9C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041576419:1":{"text":"ある……後悔はしていない。","source_cn":"有。不会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92B1DB0F0114519F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041576420:1":{"text":"そうだったのですね……","source_cn":"这样啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FA95676176E850B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041576421:1":{"text":"なら、あなたの言うその人も、あなたと同じなのかもしれないわよ。","source_cn":"你口中的他，又何尝不是另一个你呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ECFED7950060E85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡兹姆":{"text":"カジム","source":"卡兹姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔琳":{"text":"タ